# Rendered MP4s and the raw/working audio (.m4a, often 70MB+) stay out of git.
# The committed, distributable audio is the compressed mono <NN>/audio.mp3;
# vtt/meta/avatars/raw.vtt under public/videogen/<NN>/ are also committable.
public/videogen/**/*.mp4
public/videogen/**/*.m4a
